[{"client_msg_id":"98712CEB-A0C0-4B4A-ABFF-0AEB77FF993A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"その前に量子ポーテーションはよ","ts":"1630502691.458300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G++"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b91b2f6-49c3-441f-8a46-491ec8d4fdb3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いっぱんのごかていにこのスイッチ容量のものがくるのはいつだろう\n\u003chttps://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/nettech/1346072.html\u003e\n\u0026gt; Microsoftでは512ポートの採用\n400Gのやつっぽいので、 400G x 512のスイッチング容量","ts":"1630502173.457800","attachments":[{"fallback":"INTERNET Watch: 【光Ethernetの歴史と発展】400GbEはFacebookやMicrosoftのDC事業者が先行、Beyond 400G Study Groupは800Gと同時に1.6Tの標準化を主張【ネット新技術】","id":1,"title":"【光Ethernetの歴史と発展】400GbEはFacebookやMicrosoftのDC事業者が先行、Beyond 400G Study Groupは800Gと同時に1.6Tの標準化を主張【ネット新技術】","title_link":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/nettech/1346072.html","text":"　Ethernetというか10GBASE-Tに関しては、2017年から【10GBASE-T、ついに普及？】と題し、全11回と番外編2回をお届けした。だが、ツイストペアによる銅配線のEthernetは10GBASE-Tまでで、25/40GBASE-Tはまだまだ実用化には至っていない。","image_url":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/img/iw/list/1346/072/009_OptEther_059_01.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1630357200,"service_name":"INTERNET Watch","service_icon":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/nettech/1346072.html","original_url":"https://internet.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/column/nettech/1346072.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6+pc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5b30ce3-26e0-4ac4-bcb1-ad06a8f70a9c","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"今時の機種なら両方使うと速度低下ってのはほぼないですねー\n(スイッチング容量フルで使うとかルーティングしまくるとかない限り)","ts":"1630502011.456100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lcZr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42cfe301-8b88-4bc5-b8eb-b9590160c6e4","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"全然意識してなかったことですが、今までAtermWR8750Nで有線無線併用してたけど\nこれは有線無線それぞれの回線速度は低めになっちゃう仕様だったのかな","ts":"1630501867.454100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BOjDK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4323CA1C-CB64-431B-9FF2-12BD4FD01F1D","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"Dual Band非対応の機器なんかもあるので、無線APは複数欲しい","ts":"1630501741.452400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zNqc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f639485b-575c-493b-8f81-c5ae96d675fd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"案外家庭用ルータって癖のある機能が要求されて、高ければ満足な機能になるかというと、そうでもないという...","ts":"1630501658.451300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ND/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b2ad10b-d766-4040-ba80-d7f2470fb2e8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ルータとAPは分離したいが、分離するならルータが安定かつ強力(機能足らずとかはない)を希望しちゃうよね...\n実際は自分の所で動けばいいんだけど","ts":"1630501554.448800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QzH1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05B52837-F133-47A1-BFF0-913C7CD43128","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"UniFiが一応公式のAPって位置付けなんですかね\n\u003chttps://yabe.jp/gadgets/implementing-unifi/|https://yabe.jp/gadgets/implementing-unifi/\u003e\n","ts":"1630501544.448100","attachments":[{"fallback":"yabe.jp: UniFi を導入してみた | yabe.jp","id":1,"title":"UniFi を導入してみた | yabe.jp","title_link":"https://yabe.jp/gadgets/implementing-unifi/","text":"さて、価格破壊度世界最高ルーターと謳われる EdgeRouter X ですが、製造元の Ubiquiti はもう１つ価格性能比世界最高と謳われるプラットフォームを擁しております。それが UniFi です。今回はその UniFi を導入してみました。","thumb_url":"https://yabe.jp/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/unifi_v5_hero.jpg","fields":[{"title":"Written by","value":"osamu yabe","short":true},{"title":"Est. reading time","value":"2 minutes","short":true}],"blocks":null,"ts":1567417484,"service_name":"yabe.jp","service_icon":"https://i1.wp.com/yabe.jp/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/y_logo-549a8f5bv1_site_icon.png?fit=180%2C180\u0026amp;ssl=1","thumb_width":1080,"thumb_height":646,"from_url":"https://yabe.jp/gadgets/implementing-unifi/","original_url":"https://yabe.jp/gadgets/implementing-unifi/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U8CC7MDCL"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FyT/E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50be026a-f5a0-427d-b2ac-0fd0c37e930c","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"EdgeRouter-Xそのものは有線のみなのでAPは別途必須ですねー。\nWiFiルータをAPモードで使うか、APオンリーのやつ買うか","ts":"1630501487.446500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oue24"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00b31945-e6a7-4023-8c45-baf8d65bae94","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":":wakaru: で笑ってしまった","ts":"1630501385.445100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ulA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5F701A9B-9084-432D-B74D-A05D6D52D860","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"別売りのAPがある？","ts":"1630501381.445000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y6f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db84d909-48cd-4961-8361-4918664c6414","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"なるほど、Edgerouterは有線のみなのかな。","ts":"1630501363.444300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q1XD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91fd9656-79b8-437a-8e8a-21c2fad46403","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"IPoEもDS-LiteとMAP-Eで使える使えないがあったりで要注意ですねー\n(EdgeRouter-XはMAP-Eは使えないとか)\nYAMAHAルーターどっちもいけるのでつまりあとは分かるな…？","ts":"1630501332.443800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5kjj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38B2BB97-87C2-4298-AA18-D5505DBA141F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あとは、ルーターの基本性能として、IPv6対応（IPoE、クロスパス）が必要かどうかとか、ポートフォワーディングとか自鯖向け設定ができるかの有無とかですかね。","ts":"1630500577.441800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xt2H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8aca2851-c3f8-42b7-a4bc-945ae3c8e9cd","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"500台の7割でも350台なんだよなぁ…","ts":"1630500433.439700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U01J7703PFT","U8CC7MDCL"]},{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ao"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19d6d173-78b0-4ad2-a807-f5fc64acdb09","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"普通家電でもわりと厳しくなりがち","ts":"1630500336.437400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TQ1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0e366ba-3415-4c61-a8a8-6df4995403b0","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"確かに家中IoTガジェット使い始めると、本当に許容台数はそれなりに必要になってきそう...","ts":"1630500285.436900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PKPg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"932C03D5-ABB7-4C57-B5C3-AFBA60CB3897","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"最大接続台数って、それに限りなく近づくと不安定になることが多いので、実際の許容台数は7〜8割くらいで見ておいた方がいいと思います。","ts":"1630500257.436200","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1630500278.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dOyZ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e92c2aeb-b43b-43b2-9e57-12bdb2a09ca9","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"このスレで質問すると